<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Royal Table | Luxury Restaurant</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background: #fef9f0;
            color: #2c2b28;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #d4af37;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #d4af37;
        }
        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.5), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?w=1600&h=700&fit=crop');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            height: 85vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }
        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #d4af37;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 40px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #b8962e;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        /* About Section */
        .about {
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .about h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .about p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        .feature {
            background: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            width: 250px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .feature:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .feature h3 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        footer {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #aaa;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hero-text h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            nav { flex-direction: column; }
            .nav-links { gap: 1rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html" class="logo">THE ROYAL TABLE</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html">Home</a>
            <a href="menu.html">Menu</a>
            <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>Exquisite Dining</h1>
            <p>Experience the finest flavors in an atmosphere of timeless elegance.</p>
            <a href="menu.html" class="btn">Explore Menu</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about">
        <h2>Welcome to The Royal Table</h2>
        <p>Nestled in the heart of the city, our restaurant offers a culinary journey inspired by global cuisines with a touch of royal heritage. Every dish is crafted with passion and the finest ingredients.</p>
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>🌟 Michelin Starred Chef</h3>
                <p>Our head chef brings 20 years of excellence.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>🍷 Private Wine Cellar</h3>
                <p>Over 500 labels from around the world.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>✨ Bespoke Events</h3>
                <p>Tailored menus for your special occasions.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 The Royal Table – Luxury Dining. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
